<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Director General is satisfied that a licensed operator is contravening, or has contravened and is likely again to contravene, any of the conditions of its licence, the Director General may give notice in writing to the licensed operator requiring it to comply with that condition within the period prescribed in the notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If, on the expiry of the period prescribed in such notice, the licensed operator fails to comply with the condition mentioned therein, the Director General shall submit to the Minister a report of such failure by the licensed operator and the report shall be in such form as the Director General considers appropriate."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
