<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
