<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"abattoir\" means any place, with proper meat inspection facilities, for the slaughter of animals specified in the Schedule; \"Director General\" means the Director General of Veterinary Services appointed under section 3 of the Animals Ordinance 1953 and includes the Deputy Director General appointed under the same section; \"licence\" means a licence issued under Part II; \"licenced operator\" means any person or body of persons licensed under Part II to operate an abattoir; \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with the responsibility for abattoir control; \"to operate\" means to build or to manage an abattoir or to provide abattoir services. 4 BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/3/eng@> .
